@startuml TrustLens_DFD_Level0
' TrustLens — Level 0 (context) DFD
' Notation : DeMarco & Yourdon — oval = process, rectangle = external entity
' Contents : 1 process · 9 external entities · 18 flows (9 in, 9 out)
'            no data stores — level 0 carries none by convention
'
' LAYOUT NOTES — read before editing, these are the rules that keep it clean:
'  1. No "left to right direction". This diagram is radial; the
'     -up-/-down-/-left-/-right- hints place entities around the process
'     and LR mode breaks them.
'  2. At most ONE entity on the left and ONE on the right. A second one is
'     pushed an extra rank outward, its edges run long, and its two labels
'     collide. Entities above and below sit side by side on one rank with
'     short edges, so that is where the rest go.
'  3. Arrow labels stay at 2-3 words. Long labels are wide boxes that
'     overlap on curved edges.

title <b>TrustLens  —  Level 0 Context Diagram</b>

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 80

<style>
element {
  Padding 8
  Margin  12
}
</style>

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #1F3864
    FontColor       #FFFFFF
    BorderColor     #0D2137
    BorderThickness 2
}

skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #BBDEFB
    BorderColor     #1565C0
    FontColor       #0D2137
    BorderThickness 2
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color       #444444
    FontColor   #222222
    FontSize    10
}

usecase "**0.0**\n**TrustLens**\nScam Detection,\nEvidence &\nReporting System" as SYS

' --- above: submission and knowledge authoring --------------------------------
rectangle "Reporting User\n(P1 Priya / P2 Ramesh)"          as RU
rectangle "Official Guidance Bodies\n(I4C / CERT-In / RBI)"  as GB
rectangle "Knowledge Editor\n(P4 Vikram)"                    as KE

' --- left: review -------------------------------------------------------------
rectangle "Analyst\n(P3 Anjali)"        as AN

' --- right: publication gate --------------------------------------------------
rectangle "Knowledge Approver\n(P5 Meera)" as KA

' --- below: outputs and external providers ------------------------------------
rectangle "Report Recipient\n(authority / bank)" as RR
rectangle "Administrator\n(P6)"                  as AD
rectangle "Threat-Intel Providers\n(post-MVP)"   as TI
rectangle "AI Assist Provider\n(post-MVP)"       as AI

'=== flows ====================================================================
RU -down-> SYS : F1  Submitted artifacts\nF2  Corrections
SYS  -up-> RU  : F3  Verdict + trace\nF4  Report bundle

GB -down-> SYS : F10  Published advisories

KE -down-> SYS : F11  Draft rule
SYS  -up-> KE  : F12  Lint verdict

SYS -left-> AN  : F5  Queued case
AN -right-> SYS : F6  Adjudication

SYS -right-> KA : F13  Review package
KA   -left-> SYS : F14  Publish / reject

SYS -down-> RR : F9  Report export

AD   -up-> SYS : F7  Configuration
SYS -down-> AD : F8  Health + audit

SYS -down-> TI : F15  Reputation lookup
TI    -up-> SYS : F16  Provider verdict

SYS -down-> AI : F17  Content prompt
AI    -up-> SYS : F18  Checked draft

@enduml
